@startuml ideator-usecase-header
skinparam dpi 170
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam card {
  BackgroundColor #F7FBFF
  BorderColor #356282
  FontSize 14
}
title Ideator | problem-solving and decision-making use cases\nDesigned workflow — current saved setup; runtime behavior not verified
card "**Actors (same User drawn per band to keep links short)**\n• User — submit / cancel / ask-mode pauses / report test results\n• Fresh web evidence / sources — Discover research\n• One-time check-in scheduler — deadline+1 result requests" as actors
@enduml

@startuml ideator-usecase-entry
left to right direction
skinparam dpi 170
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam Padding 12
skinparam nodesep 55
skinparam ranksep 50
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #F0F6FC
  BorderColor #356282
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8DC
  BorderColor #C9A227
}
actor "User" as User
rectangle "Entry" {
  usecase "Submit problem\n(+ optional knobs)" as UC_Submit
  usecase "Run Double Diamond\nideation" as UC_Run
  usecase "Cancel run" as UC_Cancel
  UC_Submit -[hidden]right-> UC_Run
  UC_Run -[hidden]right-> UC_Cancel
  UC_Submit ..> UC_Run : <<include>>
}
User --> UC_Submit
User --> UC_Cancel
note top of UC_Submit
Only problem required. Knobs: ideas, pretotypes, sources,
country, language, format, mode. Defaults: 5/4/5/US/
English/markdown/auto. Only mode persists.
end note
note top of UC_Run
Includes in order: Problem diamond → Solution diamond →
Pretotypes and delivery. Auto selects without ask pauses.
end note
note top of UC_Cancel
Stop; mark CANCELLED;\ndelete run check-ins.
end note
@enduml

@startuml ideator-usecase-problem
left to right direction
skinparam dpi 170
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam Padding 14
skinparam nodesep 60
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #F0F6FC
  BorderColor #356282
}
actor "Fresh web\nevidence / sources" as Web
actor "User" as User
rectangle "1–2. Problem diamond" {
  usecase "Research problem\nand challenges" as UC_Research
  usecase "Consult distinct\nresearch sources" as UC_Sources
  usecase "Score and propose\nchallenges" as UC_ScoreCh
  usecase "Select challenges\nto pursue" as UC_SelCh
  usecase "Ask-mode pause:\nuser chooses / steers challenges" as UC_AskCh #FFF2CC
  UC_Research -[hidden]right-> UC_Sources
  UC_Sources -[hidden]right-> UC_ScoreCh
  UC_ScoreCh -[hidden]right-> UC_SelCh
  UC_SelCh -[hidden]right-> UC_AskCh
  UC_Research ..> UC_Sources : <<include>>
  UC_ScoreCh ..> UC_SelCh : <<include>>
  UC_AskCh ..> UC_SelCh : <<extend>>\n[ask mode]
}
Web --> UC_Sources
User --> UC_AskCh
@enduml

@startuml ideator-usecase-solution
left to right direction
skinparam dpi 170
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam Padding 14
skinparam nodesep 60
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #F0F6FC
  BorderColor #356282
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8DC
  BorderColor #C9A227
}
actor "User" as User
rectangle "3–4. Solution diamond" {
  usecase "Generate ideas per\nselected challenge" as UC_Ideas
  usecase "Score, weight, rank\nideas and form concepts" as UC_ScoreIdeas
  usecase "Select concepts\nto pretotype" as UC_SelConcept
  usecase "Ask-mode pause:\nuser chooses concepts" as UC_AskConcept #FFF2CC
  UC_Ideas -[hidden]right-> UC_ScoreIdeas
  UC_ScoreIdeas -[hidden]right-> UC_SelConcept
  UC_SelConcept -[hidden]right-> UC_AskConcept
  UC_ScoreIdeas ..> UC_SelConcept : <<include>>
  UC_AskConcept ..> UC_SelConcept : <<extend>>\n[ask mode]
}
User --> UC_AskConcept
note bottom of UC_ScoreIdeas
Weighted = (cheap + simple) × evidence × uniqueness.
Auto: top 5 ideas; top 2 concepts.
end note
@enduml

@startuml ideator-usecase-pretotypes
left to right direction
skinparam dpi 170
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam Padding 14
skinparam nodesep 60
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #F0F6FC
  BorderColor #356282
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8DC
  BorderColor #C9A227
}
actor "User" as User
rectangle "5. Pretotypes and delivery" {
  usecase "Design pretotype\ntests and materials" as UC_Pretotype
  usecase "Select tests\nand start dates" as UC_SelTest
  usecase "Ask-mode pause:\nuser chooses tests / starts" as UC_AskTest #FFF2CC
  usecase "Deliver reports,\nkey results and board" as UC_Deliver
  UC_Pretotype -[hidden]right-> UC_SelTest
  UC_SelTest -[hidden]right-> UC_AskTest
  UC_AskTest -[hidden]right-> UC_Deliver
  UC_Pretotype ..> UC_SelTest : <<include>>
  UC_AskTest ..> UC_SelTest : <<extend>>\n[ask mode]
}
User --> UC_AskTest
note bottom of UC_Pretotype
Hypothesis + success number + deadline + go/no-go.
Materials drafted only; people run tests.
If a start date is known, Select tests includes
Schedule deadline+1 check-in (Follow-up band).
end note
@enduml

@startuml ideator-usecase-followup
left to right direction
skinparam dpi 170
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam Padding 14
skinparam nodesep 60
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #F0F6FC
  BorderColor #356282
}
actor "User" as User
actor "One-time\ncheck-in scheduler" as Sched
rectangle "Follow-up after human-run tests" {
  usecase "Schedule deadline+1\ncheck-in" as UC_Schedule
  usecase "Ask for test results\nat check-in" as UC_AskResults
  usecase "Recommend go,\nno-go or iterate" as UC_Decide
  usecase "Record outcome\nin report(s)" as UC_Record
  UC_Schedule -[hidden]right-> UC_AskResults
  UC_AskResults -[hidden]right-> UC_Decide
  UC_Decide -[hidden]right-> UC_Record
  UC_Schedule ..> UC_AskResults : <<include>>
  UC_AskResults ..> UC_Decide : <<include>>
  UC_Decide ..> UC_Record : <<include>>
}
User --> UC_AskResults
Sched --> UC_Schedule
Sched --> UC_AskResults
@enduml

@startuml ideator-usecase-legend
skinparam dpi 170
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam card {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8DC
  BorderColor #C9A227
  FontSize 14
}
card "**Legend / qualifications**\n• Yellow ovals = ask-mode <<extend>> pauses; auto mode uses base selects without pausing.\n• Each use case appears once; phase bands are separate PlantUML renders composed top-down for readable package membership.\n• Go / no-go / iterate are recommendations after observed results; no automatic new ideation cycle is defined.\n• Designed from the live Ideator profile. Runtime behavior not verified." as legend
@enduml
